cff-version: 1.2.0
title: SCALE-TRACK
message: >-
  If you use this software, please cite both the software and the paper it
  accompanies.
type: software
authors:
  - given-names: Sergey
    family-names: Lesnik
    affiliation: Wikki GmbH
  - given-names: Henrik
    family-names: Rusche
    affiliation: Wikki GmbH
  - given-names: Silvio
    family-names: Schmalfuß
    affiliation: Leibniz Institute for Tropospheric Research (TROPOS)
abstract: >-
  Asynchronous two-way coupled Euler-Lagrange particle tracking for
  heterogeneous architectures.  The continuous phase is solved by OpenFOAM on
  CPUs; the dispersed phase is tracked in Julia on GPUs.  The coupling
  algorithm removes the synchronisation barrier between the two by
  extrapolating the source terms and by decomposing the Lagrangian phase
  independently of the Eulerian one.
